<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's Sampo H1 net down 19.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's Sampo H1 net down 19.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-June 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				10,698  vs   10,569</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    461  vs	676</p>
<p>    Net profit				 475  vs	590</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in single T$) 0.68  vs     0.93</p>
<p>NOTE - Sampo Corp is one of Taiwan's major electronic appliance manufacturers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
